      "text": "REVIEWED SCENARIO\nMISSISSAUGA / 05\nCooksville\nA meeting point for transit, housing and health care\nThe completed 32-storey Alba at Fairview joins\nCooksville’s existing context. Proposals cluster\naround Cooksville GO, Hurontario and Dundas. The\n34-storey model at 51-55 Dundas West follows\nsubmitted plans and retains the heritage building.\nMODEL LIMIT\nAlba’s exterior follows City-approved plans and developer\nreferences, with approximate details. The GO model is a dated\nseven-tower concept with estimated heights. Each project\nretains its own evidence and limitations.\nAlba approved plans\nCooksville GO TOC\n51-55 Dundas plans\nHospital project\nPlan source\nFUTURE MISSISSAUGA\nVISUAL POLISH / 26 SEPTEMBER 2026\n22\n"
    },
    {
