      "key": "cooksville-perspective",
      "text": "PERSPECTIVE / FUTURE\nTHE CITY AT A CLOSER SCALE\nCooksville\nA composed architectural perspective\nThe closer camera reveals sourced building shapes,\nmapped streets and layered landscape. Lighting, tree\ncrowns and surface finishes serve the illustration; this\nis a rendered model, not a future photograph.\nMODEL LIMIT\nAlba’s exterior follows City-approved plans and developer\nreferences, with approximate details. The GO model is a dated\nseven-tower concept with estimated heights. Each project\nretains its own evidence and limitations.\nAlba approved plans\nCooksville GO TOC\n51-55 Dundas plans\nHospital project\nPlan source\nFUTURE MISSISSAUGA\nPERSPECTIVE VIEW / NO BUILD-OUT YEAR ASSUMED\n23\n"
